  "content": "\n\n<p>\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/client_backpack/minecraft_title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"橫幅\">\n</p>\n<div>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faewulf/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFaeWulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> \n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h4>⚠️ 注意：此模組不會新增任何具備實際功能的背包，僅提供客戶端視覺效果</h4>\n<h2>📖 概述</h2>\n<p><strong>Client Wearables</strong> 是一款外觀模組，可新增動態視覺背包；\n取代其他背包模組現有的背包模型。\n此模組完全僅限<strong>客戶端</strong>使用，<strong>不需要</strong>在伺服器端安裝。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1265/756/backpack-showcase-png.png\" alt=\"展示圖\"></p>\n<h2>✨ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>替換背包模型</strong>：可替換來自其他背包模組的模型，例如：Sophisticated Backpacks、Traveler's Backpack、Inmis Backpacks。</li>\n<li><strong>動態外觀：</strong>模型與視覺效果會根據玩家物品欄內容進行變更。</li>\n<li><strong>僅需安裝於客戶端</strong></li>\n<li>支援<strong>單人遊戲</strong>與<strong>多人遊戲</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>不會</strong>影響遊戲機制，確保公平的遊戲體驗。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⛓️‍💥 相容性</h2>\n<p>此模組設計為與其他模組相容。\n如果您遇到任何問題，請至該模組的問題追蹤頁面回報。</p>\n<p>目前支援的背包模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traveler's Backpack</li>\n<li>Inmis</li>\n<li>Sophisticated Backpacks</li>\n<li>Sophisticated Backpacks（非官方 Fabric 移植版）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1265/748/poster-1-png.png\" alt=\"圖片 1\"></p>\n<h2>⚠️ 警告</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>為了<strong>公平遊戲</strong>，其他玩家的妝飾內容僅在伺服器也安裝了此模組時才能看見。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚙️ 設定檔</h2>\n<p>設定檔位置：config/client_backpack.toml</p>\n<h2>📌 必要模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faewulf's Lib</li>\n<li>Fabric API（僅限 Fabric 載入器）</li>\n<li>LambDynamicLights（選配，用於支援動態光源）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>👍 支援</h2>\n<p>如需支援、功能建議或錯誤回報，請前往該模組的 GitHub Issues 頁面。\n或加入我的 Discord 伺服器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/client_backpack/sprite.png?raw=true\" alt=\"展示圖 1\"></p>\n<h2>📃 授權條款</h2>\n<p>您可以在您的模組包中使用此模組，只要給予適當的署名即可。</p>",
